  "description": "\"How can I, who only have a Taekwondo Dan’s certificate, unify the martial arts…?” The Murim Alliance, representing the political faction, and the Demon Cult led by Cheonma are in conflict. The protagonist, who is a job seeker, becomes possessed by the Heavenly Demon of the Demonic Cult, and the Murim League devises a plan to gain peace in the martial arts world by breaking the Heavenly Demon's power. Namgung Jin of the Namgung family steps forward as a volunteer...\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/cheonma_virginity), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/cheonma_virginity), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000070137), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=250368), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/67000843) \n\n**Official Translations:**  \nJapanese: [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.jp/comic/tenma_doutei), [Beltoon](https://www.beltoon.jp/detail/tenma_doutei)  \nOthers: [Spanish](https://www.lezhin.es/detail/mi-virginidad-en-sacrificio), [Thai](https://www.boomtoon.com/detail/save_the_world), [T.Chinese](https://www.bomtoon.tw/detail/cheonma)",
